  "intro": {
    "cards": [
      {
        "title": "Mine / yours / his / hers",
        "title_cz": "Mine / yours / his / hers",
        "text_first": true,
        "points": [
          "**my** needs a noun: **my book**.",
          "**mine** has no noun: **This book is mine.**",
          "Both say whose it is. English changes the word.",
          "Czech *moje* does both jobs. English does not."
        ],
        "table": {
          "headers": ["Before a noun", "Alone"],
          "rows": [
            ["**my** book", "**mine**"],
